{"4256080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lost Bunker", "steam_appid": 4256080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Lost Bunker is a single-player horror game set in the 1980s.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in and beneath an old cemetery, where the player explores graves, small buildings, and an underground bunker connected to the site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on exploration, searching environments, finding keys and codes, opening locked doors, and progressing through enclosed areas such as tunnels and a maze-like bunker. The player must investigate strange sounds, follow clues left in the environment, and move deeper underground to understand what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes dark locations, limited visibility, simple puzzles, and moments of pursuit that require the player to escape or defend themselves. Lost Bunker tells its story through events, locations, and discoveries rather than direct exposition, creating a grounded horror experience based on tension, mystery, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.poster.avif?t=1787168818\" width=598 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.webm?t=1787168818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.mp4?t=1787168818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features for the game!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Style:</strong> The game features a <strong>PSX-style aesthetic</strong>, reminiscent of classic PS1 titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> The events take place in the <strong>1980s</strong>, specifically in the year 1980.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics:</strong> It includes an <strong>item system</strong> and a system to <strong>save your progress/achievements</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Modes:</strong> Choose your preferred style, such as <strong><i>PSX</i></strong>, <strong><i>VHS</i></strong>, <strong><i>GBC</i></strong>, or <strong><i>Black &amp; White</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> The game consists of <strong>two chapters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Feature:</strong> In certain parts of the game, you may need to use the <strong>microphone system</strong>; you must remain cautious and quiet while playing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Lost Bunker is a single-player horror game set in the 1980s.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in and beneath an old cemetery, where the player explores graves, small buildings, and an underground bunker connected to the site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on exploration, searching environments, finding keys and codes, opening locked doors, and progressing through enclosed areas such as tunnels and a maze-like bunker. The player must investigate strange sounds, follow clues left in the environment, and move deeper underground to understand what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes dark locations, limited visibility, simple puzzles, and moments of pursuit that require the player to escape or defend themselves. Lost Bunker tells its story through events, locations, and discoveries rather than direct exposition, creating a grounded horror experience based on tension, mystery, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.poster.avif?t=1787168818\" width=598 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.webm?t=1787168818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256080/extras/f6aeaf623fb36f2cee69f7aaa1d50f91.mp4?t=1787168818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features for the game!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Style:</strong> The game features a <strong>PSX-style aesthetic</strong>, reminiscent of classic PS1 titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> The events take place in the <strong>1980s</strong>, specifically in the year 1980.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics:</strong> It includes an <strong>item system</strong> and a system to <strong>save your progress/achievements</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Modes:</strong> Choose your preferred style, such as <strong><i>PSX</i></strong>, <strong><i>VHS</i></strong>, <strong><i>GBC</i></strong>, or <strong><i>Black &amp; White</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> The game consists of <strong>two chapters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Feature:</strong> In certain parts of the g